# Environment files. Only VITE_-prefixed public values belong in .env — those
# are inlined into the client bundle. Server-side secrets (service role key,
# Stripe, Resend, Twilio, Printavo, Dropbox) belong in Supabase Edge Function
# secrets, never in this repo.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

